    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ほ、本当ですか！　\r\nやった！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おめでとう！",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！　ありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "やっぱり、チョコ押しが効いたんですかね？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\nアイドルとして、上手く個性を押し出せてたと思うぞ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "良かった……\r\nこれもプロデューサーさんのおかげですね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　俺は何も……",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "いいえ！　チョコアイドルとしてどうしたらいいか、\r\nアドバイスをくれたおかげです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "本当に、ありがとうございました！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\n智代子の力になれてたなら嬉しいよ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、一次審査を通過できたのは\r\n智代子が頑張ったからだと思うぞ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私が頑張ったから……ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "チョコアイドルっていう個性を考え出したのも\r\nどう見せるかの部分で努力したのも智代子だ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "レッスンもたくさんこなして\r\nチョコアイドルとして、よく頑張ったな",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……えへへ\r\nそう言ってもらえると、すっごく嬉しいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "なんだか、チョコを食べたときみたいに、幸せです",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "よしっ！　これからもっともっと頑張って、\r\n次の審査も突破できるようにしないとですね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000101/7010001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その意気だ！\r\n全力でバックアップするから、次も一緒に突破しよう！",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001010110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい！\r\nこれからもよろしくお願いします。プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
